  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Wield Unnatural Psionic Power</p></blockquote><p>An alien influence has wrapped its tendrils around your mind, granting you psionic power. You can now touch other minds with it and alter the world around you. Will this power shine from you as a beacon of hope, or will you be a terror to those who feel the stab of your mind?</p><p>Perhaps a psychic wind from the Astral Plane carried psionic energy to you, or you were exposed to the warping influence of the Far Realm. Or a mind flayer tadpole was implanted in you, but your transformation never happened, and the tadpole's psionic power is now yours. However you acquired it, your mind is aflame with this power.</p><h3>Aberrant Sorcery Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.CZlU16623RpD6UYD]{Psionic Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.OS7c0mOj1rIftDcx]{Telepathic Speech}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.MBbXMAIOeUiitRJp]{Psionic Sorcery}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ns5VjAnnHkaDdQRl]{Psychic Defenses}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.onNxRMWcU926MCrO]{Revelation in Flesh}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.HE4qiCzk2QVQDaDk]{Warping Implosion}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Psionic Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Sorcerer Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.pGP4tUiw5jIwJ7Gq]{Arms of Hadar}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCalmEmotio]{Calm Emotions}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDetectThou]{Detect Thoughts}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDissonantW]{Dissonant Whispers}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.txZXlAW3p4AuqhIF]{Mind Sliver}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.azhfcdy96idtT6uT]{Hunger of Hadar}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSending000]{Sending}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplEvardsBlac]{Evard's Black Tentacles}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.aN1q4UJrbMIsxUmQ]{Summon Aberration}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRarysTelep]{Rary's Telepathic Bond}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplTelekinesi]{Telekinesis}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
